5. What is SCSS?

SCSS lets you organize styles with additional features.
button {
  color: white;
}

button:hover {
  background-color: black;
}

button {
  color: white;

  &:hover {
    background-color: black;
  }
}
Here, &:hover refers to the same button when the mouse is over it.